964]\r\n- Fix minor font and theme issues [#12814]\r\n- Fix 'Remove' button in Plugin Data being enabled when no row is selected [#12916]\r\n- Sanitize attachment file names before saving [#13114]", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/keepassxreboot/keepassxc/releases/294949348/reactions", "total_count": 168, "+1": 88, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 25, "confused": 0, "heart": 31, "rocket": 21, "eyes": 3}}